{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "76edaac6f1d731587dd8f6de3755bf9fba58744b39d1507d223c96cac569c048", "ja": "物語の始まり", "zh": "故事的开始", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2a601c957e82a7564b84961570c6c3b0d5e8381f370e05e4db064edf7f340e37", "ja": "いよいよ通し稽古が始まった。『真珠星』と\n『織姫』は仲の良い姉妹。事情があり、両親\nとは離れて二人で慎ましく暮らしている。\nある日いつものようにバイトに行った織姫が\nスカウトされ、アイドルになる事を決める。", "zh": "终于开始连排了。《珍珠星》和\n《织女》是一对感情要好的姐妹。由于一些原因，\n她们离开父母，两人过着俭朴的生活。\n一天，像往常一样去打工的织女被发掘，\n决定成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3b57cc0e9bc39ea61a80e62aa0229c5664144edea5a14701d0f0f3e2a23951bf", "ja": "（芝居の稽古を始めて、2週間が過ぎた。今日は\n劇場のステージを使って、初めての通し稽古だ）", "zh": "（开始进行戏剧排练后，已经过去了2周。今天要在剧场的舞台上进行第一次完整排练）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ef618d77455e74330b574842f2cbeaad5fb403bda404e0ac56fd838681002175", "ja": "（心なしか、桃子が緊張しているように見えるな……）", "zh": "（总觉得桃子好像有些紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "5a91224116b1f5e666f8ec018e65fb2db9ae665e6d0fa0195d53c2ef32ab65d4", "ja": "{$P$}！\n全員そろったから、始めるね！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n人都到齐了，这就开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8c7507f3e27bc77b4343618da441d86491e5af66ba17fbb97a40ae7c409f6f6b", "ja": "ああ。よろしくな、みんな！", "zh": "啊，拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "98d40614e93326b8a05d4be767713d3989cfccd0e7b283a1488b4ffda1bf7965", "ja": "（主人公は、仲の良い二人姉妹。母親が病気のため\n遠方で入院中。両親と離れ、二人で暮らしている）", "zh": "（主人公是关系亲密的两姐妹。因为母亲生病，正在远方住院。她们离开父母，两人一起生活。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1005_se", "source_sha256": "87e635fd0d100f0fbbd5243bd40b01894e9976e8c04c32bfc008a2e2a25d0c8d", "ja": "バタバタバタ……バタン！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "180e0911e8654ff32cbe204b7f8cf880d6bf3c7a3a699318b7fcd1fcf8f48fd8", "ja": "も～、真珠星（スピカ）ちゃん！\nどうして起こしてくれないの～！？", "zh": "真是的～，角宿一！\n为什么没叫我起床啦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "ac88146be594fb0ed8905ef5dcd9a8b1ce569844227bf785eff776d070a61355", "ja": "私は起こしたよ！　織姫（おりひめ）お姉ちゃんが、\n勝手に二度寝してたんでしょ。", "zh": "我明明叫过你了！是织姬姐姐你自己又睡回去了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "57aad45037b0d859010bb2b42060cd657647005d1577dc25f6e1873bfd93325b", "ja": "お姉ちゃんが縦に起きるまで、\nちゃんと見てって言ったじゃ～ん！", "zh": "我不是说过要好好看着姐姐，直到她坐起来为止嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "a5e8b8f9067c05701707655cc208151c358a3dd24ea2ece6b00dc35fb4069b7a", "ja": "知らないよ！？　それよりいいの？　もう7時45分\nだけど、今日はバイト8時って言ってなかった？", "zh": "我不管！？那还好意思说我？现在都7点45分了，你今天不是说打工8点开始吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "4a55c372a58791adf8c9d63eee4083dbcc8f66ffa2b0f8634209ddfa2598451a", "ja": "よくない～～っ！\nああっ、お父さんに電話したかったのにぃ！", "zh": "不好啦～～！\n啊啊，我还想给爸爸打电话呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "1d7f4958f20f815b4f4140369d503d8835202427e41fee2e28b117ef4d5d8006", "ja": "今日は私がしておくから。\n行ってらっしゃい！　車に気を付けてね！", "zh": "今天我来做就好。\n路上小心，注意车辆哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "9024e8f703da3a9f2930f435ff57447b8bea2206267d865dea4c010b16f838d7", "ja": "うんっ、行ってきます！！！\n帰りはいつもと同じだからっ！", "zh": "嗯，我出发啦！！！\n回来的时间和往常一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "01c61e41cc6f6e2a699feba38e67473c4725b87b993728b104b905d78676d5c2", "ja": "はいはい。", "zh": "好好好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1014_se", "source_sha256": "b08b2d1d7a19aecc80184950449a31b3503d520f12ba03859a1b4adc0e84b9fc", "ja": "バタン！　……バタバタバタ", "zh": "砰！……啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "556fe09d52da202b87893160187de883c7a0ef9ede2acd1becbc0e0efe8cd23b", "ja": "まったく、毎日慌ただしいなぁ……。\nさてと、お父さんに電話しなくちゃ。", "zh": "真是的，每天都忙忙碌碌的……  \n好了，该给爸爸打电话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "22e18f0b2bd13c96516c778ef9b3c9894a5b6e31d3ff230a4f888dcb7cb8101e", "ja": "もしもし、お父さん？\nうん、お姉ちゃんはバイトに行ったよ。", "zh": "喂，爸爸？\n嗯，姐姐去打工了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "578a5463ae4c9d1b89aea0e8c0e1554d1b103b02b25e13a497387ccd8cc535dc", "ja": "大丈夫！　心配しなくても、こっちは元気に\nしてるってば。それより、お母さんの具合はどう？", "zh": "没事的！不用担心，我都说了\n我这边挺好的啦。比起这个，妈妈的身体怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "fb91b01e09cd64a4a3cbcca4e6329a74801c570e2b00ce156a883f42421d1a19", "ja": "うん、うん……そっか。\nそれじゃ、また夜にね。", "zh": "嗯，嗯……这样啊。\n那就晚上再聊哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1019_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "b4968ad4191ee53bb963a5decf8c1e0549d4205b383f8cb29f6668224c8bcce1", "ja": "……私も、学校に行かなくちゃ。\n夕ご飯、何作ろうかな……。", "zh": "……我也得去上学了。\n晚饭做点什么好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "89ecf037756f57b7761a9acce6be89a122034baa4d3d9fde5a8b10aa949ab5a8", "ja": "たまにはお魚が食べたいけど、高いし……\nうーん、今日も特売の鶏むね肉かな……。", "zh": "偶尔也想吃鱼，可是太贵了……\n嗯——今天还是买特价的鸡胸肉吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "c541df8b073d92099f916d19a9de83ffbfb7d347fed713d04b6030ee798bcf11", "ja": "はぁ……貧乏って辛い。お姉ちゃんはあんなだし、\nやっぱり私が勉強して、いい大学にいかないと。", "zh": "唉……贫穷真难熬。姐姐又是那样，\n看来我还是得好好学习，考上好大学才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "40bcf6be0a361156438a616236ae0ed266de252d9e7245a039bc571bb0356801", "ja": "そうしたらお母さんの病気も、\n治せるかもしれないもんね……。", "zh": "那样的话，妈妈的病说不定也能治好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "c775c171b8964c7d35fde766a0d8959862b77918c6920ede9ca58182a79970b9", "ja": "ただいま～っ！！！　ねえねえ真珠星、\n聞いて聞いてっ！　私、今日、スカウトされたの！", "zh": "我回来啦～！！！　呐呐，真珠星，听我说听我说！我今天被星探相中了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "ccddbfd756cf809cd751222c4f9ae23a9a902666147679d44e9da16203b3107f", "ja": "え……何？\nスカウトって、なんの？", "zh": "诶……什么？\n你说的星探，是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "3bcadf7d70ee43ee8ebfef311d3877509f36544080293110d26fdbbb9628346f", "ja": "あのね、アイドルのマネージャーさんなんだって！\n名刺ももらったよ、ほらっ！", "zh": "听说是偶像的经纪人！\n还给了我名片呢，你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "3e5bf318c30e71c2537b1bc4eb86b28f298516b8dcf59135d6909aa05e5fb92f", "ja": "…………これ、本物？", "zh": "…………这名片，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "6a87ba11a2fa4b78e99816be220966e0ebcb9534650215b1d0fa8f5e67579393", "ja": "本物だよーっ！　たぶん！", "zh": "是真的啦——！大概！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "51254aea18b26823bdbd06f4b7fb6f8012dae8a8c2997a1e80c246f71cc3e239", "ja": "もう、多分じゃわからないでしょ！\n貸して、調べてあげるから。", "zh": "真是的，只说“可能”根本搞不清楚吧！\n给我，我来帮你查。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "5d4e00ff04551a8a3209190c5f14fd46911ff9863d269d41440f27983376341e", "ja": "えっと、御梨音（みりおん）プロ……あ、出てきた。\n電話番号は……あってる。", "zh": "那个，我看看……御梨音（MILLION）制作人……啊，出来了。\n电话号码……没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "2cd5f163086866b84ef996d6ea4ee6493b255ffd6ae2258d3e65bbd462b474bd", "ja": "やったーっ、本物だーっ！", "zh": "太好啦——！是真的啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "8837a7001c6c22ba774a21a80267db6d23047239ec2661c759c0fb72f4381c2c", "ja": "ま、まだわからないでしょ！　電話するから待ってて！\n……あ、もしもし、御梨音プロさんですか？", "zh": "还、还不确定吧！我这就打电话，你等着！\n……啊，你好，请问是御梨音制作公司吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "2f9021829bab96e596081f245295271ff5da918ef5aaa2a3be04d5362fb9d507", "ja": "そちらに、神宮寺さんという方は……いらっしゃる？\nあの、マネージャーさんって本当ですか？", "zh": "那边有一位叫神宫寺的人吗……？\n那个，请问您真的是经纪人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "b02b932172b994a7692a6787885f46a7d883cef96d6582c2c7c480b802ad3f53", "ja": "あ、そうですか……はい。\nありがとうございます……。", "zh": "啊，是这样啊……好的。\n谢谢您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "a87e75e9688fe974df3cb0eb1eb6bc350670b9609e44bc7767e0bd0b7a0d0e80", "ja": "本物！？　本物かな！？", "zh": "真的！？是真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "ba6d3a9b3c4bdec437f888dc809717f38a3a4a2ba4bd9f84fe92a53839014688", "ja": "……本物みたい。", "zh": "……好像是真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "19240c0813f5802949733ba34b075761ab8281bb020c9785f6bdda67af2053fc", "ja": "やったーっ！！！", "zh": "太棒啦——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "327de738089136d5047bd9cdf8295a2da0fd145c9166e81f7fe998bee9cfb027", "ja": "ねえねえ、やってみてもいいっ？　アイドル！", "zh": "那个那个，我也可以试试看吗？当偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "843d544645523f048ea64ef4a7b55f4a77381663ca640a256847deefa3724fa5", "ja": "いいと思うけど……でもアイドルって、レッスンとか\nけっこうお金が掛かるんじゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "我觉得可以……不过，偶像不是要上训练课之类的，花不少钱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1040_029umi", "source_sha256": "7b4c64291c6b84337b73159bed4883a7a60d8d3639684eb4256dc4f37d03bc22", "ja": "研修生になるにはお金が掛かるらしいんだけど、\nマネージャーさんが紹介してくれるからタダだって！", "zh": "听说成为研修生是要花钱的，\n不过经理介绍的话就免费啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "6e716f296ed6b9093f795bab592ca6945a169d8519e196cb6401631e3dcec3f5", "ja": "へー、そうなんだ。まぁ、\nお金が掛からないならいいんじゃない？", "zh": "哦——原来是这样啊。嗯，只要不用花钱，那不就挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "f7eaece4d662a10ee157cec2917c58a22e7143f817579a42665208ee10f46750", "ja": "うんっ！　真珠星、ありがとーっ！", "zh": "嗯！真珠星，谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1043_049mom", "source_sha256": "9b49f809514880434727b9e2b29a64be8093700d2d2598c0d795a01e651c37b4", "ja": "あ、でもお父さんとお母さんには自分で報告してね。", "zh": "啊，不过要自己向爸爸妈妈报告哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "0e86bbd591b945eee4ce29f83fae25c18fbf801de2cb2145ca0b69b3ad784c6c", "ja": "わかった、電話するっ！\n……あ、もしもし、お父さん？　私っ！", "zh": "我知道了，这就打电话！\n……啊，喂，爸爸吗？是我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "2ecb30fcb28d5c92b113530cc7379d32a82913ec1a267a441caec55049289f64", "ja": "姉はアイドルになると、\nあっという間に注目される存在になった。", "zh": "姐姐成为偶像后，转眼间就成了备受瞩目的人物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0329_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_03_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "cfbcce96befbac4ad731f564d39ba45971e0ce5ccf7166c7b17364bf5f33afb4", "ja": "そう。\n文字通りの、『スター』になったのだ。", "zh": "没错。\n她成了名副其实的“明星”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
